<p>
    Chandrasekaran Joseph Vijay, popularly known as Thalapathy Vijay, is an Indian actor-turned-politician and the Chief Minister-designate of Tamil Nadu. A leading star of Tamil cinema with over 65 films, he earned massive popularity through romantic, action, and socially themed blockbusters before retiring in 2024 to launch the Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam (TVK). In the 2026 elections, TVK emerged as the single largest party, marking a historic political debut.
